      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انغسل</span></b>  said of a thing is quasi-pass. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَسَلَهُ</span>
[i. e. it signifies <i>It became washed,</i> or <i>washed off</i>].
(O, TA.) [See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غِسْلِينٌ</span>.]

